Route102_Text_H0::
    .string "The grass here is taller than me.\n"
    .string "It gets right up my nose and…\p"
    .string "Fwa… fwaaa…\p"
    .string "…It went away. I hate that.$"

Route102_Text_H1_0::
    .string "Got POKéMON? Then you're a TRAINER,\n"
    .string "and TRAINERS can't say no.\p"
    .string "I don't care if you're CHAMPION of\n"
    .string "the moon!$"

Route102_Text_H1_1::
    .string "Should've asked first.$"

Route102_Text_H1_2::
    .string "Next time, tell me you're a\n"
    .string "CHAMPION before I pick a fight!$"

Route102_Text_H2_0::
    .string "Eyes met! That's the rule!\n"
    .string "My BUG POKéMON grew up in this\l"
    .string "grass!$"

Route102_Text_H2_1::
    .string "Squashed flat!$"

Route102_Text_H2_2::
    .string "A rule's a rule. I'd call you out\n"
    .string "again tomorrow, and lose again.$"

Route102_Text_H3_0::
    .string "I'll be a GYM LEADER one day.\p"
    .string "A win over KANTO's CHAMPION would\n"
    .string "look lovely on my record.$"

Route102_Text_H3_1::
    .string "It looks lovely on yours instead.$"

Route102_Text_H3_2::
    .string "Right. More POKéMON, more training,\n"
    .string "fewer speeches.$"

Route102_Text_H4::
    .string "I'm going to catch a TREECKO!\p"
    .string "There's one in PETALBURG WOODS\n"
    .string "that guards a big tree. It won't\l"
    .string "let anyone near it.\p"
    .string "…I might catch a different one.$"

Route102_Text_H5_0::
    .string "You were a beginner once, right?\n"
    .string "I still am! Battle me anyway!$"

Route102_Text_H5_1::
    .string "I really thought I had a chance…$"

Route102_Text_H5_2::
    .string "Still no wins. But I'm losing to\n"
    .string "better TRAINERS every week.$"
